const MAP_NOTES={"99502":"Back rooms of the Cheongun Village clinic, the building with the green hospital sign out front.","99503":"Storage room in the Cheongun Village fire station. The room is locked, so bring the Fire Station Storage key.","99504":"Clinic by Compound Charlie, south-west of Cheongun Village.","99505":"Roadside clinic at Pyonghwa Village. Usually one yellow locker.","99506":"Clinic in the middle of Tong-il Village.","99507":"Locker room in the green building in south-west Deadtown, by the jacket hanging on the wall.","99508":"Clinic at Imjin Farmland. There is a keypad door here too.","99509":"Clinic next to Wolves Stadium.","6039":"Hanex Bank tower in The Grid (G6). Critical-threat area. The Hanex Guard Station key room is on an upper floor near the vault. The map marks a safe and a keypad door here. This is the Hanex tower, not one of the branch vaults, so the Bank Branch Vault Access card is not for this building. Vault contents are not confirmed as fixed drops.","99101":"Hanex bank branch in Cheongun Village (F4), on the south side of the main road, east of the roundabout and below the casino. The map marks a safe and a keypad door here. The vault needs a Car Battery for the sparking power panel, the Bank Branch Vault Access card found inside the bank, and a four-digit code. A note inside gives three of the digits; try 0 to 9 for the last. There is no universal code.","99102":"Hanex bank branch in the north of Songdo Wharf. The map marks a safe and a keypad door here. The vault needs a Car Battery for the sparking power panel, the Bank Branch Vault Access card found inside the bank, and a four-digit code. A note inside gives three of the digits; try 0 to 9 for the last. There is no universal code.","99103":"Hanex bank branch north-east of Wolves Stadium, on the south edge of The Grid (G7). The vault needs a Car Battery for the sparking power panel, the Bank Branch Vault Access card found inside the bank, and a four-digit code. A note inside gives three of the digits; try 0 to 9 for the last. There is no universal code.","99104":"Hanex bank branch in south Hajin, just below Wolves Stadium. The map marks a safe and a keypad door here. The vault needs a Car Battery for the sparking power panel, the Bank Branch Vault Access card found inside the bank, and a four-digit code. A note inside gives three of the digits; try 0 to 9 for the last. There is no universal code.","99500":"North Korean forces have taken over a former Russian facility on the edge of Hajin's borders. Search the cargo bays and vehicle depots, head down to the underground labs and production lines, and try to get into the sealed Deep Vault. A maze of tunnels with shifting hazards means you will need to plan ahead, bring specialised gear and work as a squad."};
